Package: generalClusterExp
Type: Package
Title: General Cluster Experiment Estimators under Network Interference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yihui", "He", email = "yihuihe@upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the MRN, IPTW, and CRN linear-weighted Hajek estimators
    for cluster-randomized experiments with cross-cluster network interference,
    together with conservative HAC variance estimators. Each top-level function
    returns the overall, direct, indirect and total causal effects, all
    well-defined marginal and non-marginal population average potential
    outcomes, and variance estimates for every quantity. The estimands follow
    Section 4-5 of the companion manuscript; the variance estimators follow
    Section 6 (Theorem var_1 Loewner-max kernel under cluster-level Bernoulli
    randomization, the bias-corrected estimator under complete randomization,
    and Theorem var_2 / K3+ kernel for the cluster-agnostic CRN estimator).
